@title Drive run at 1920 shows the travel brake, the wind and the stop distance of an axis
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# The brake-and-wind fixture is the travel project with a 15 N m spring brake behind the drive's brake output and an 8 m/s wind on 30 m2 with a gust after 20 s.
# 1790 runs at 1366x768 and 1790b is the same walk-through at 1920x1080 (the Hold to press buttons of the Live card sit at other coordinates there).
open qa/fixtures/travel-brake-wind.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 20
shot drive-started-brake-closed
expect "brake closed"
# Step 2 (S2): the brake opens above the drive's brake frequency and the wind shows in the reading.
mouse_down 371 341
wait 400
expect "brake open"
expect "wind"
shot running-in-wind
mouse_up 371 341
wait 450
wait 450
expect "last stop"
expect "Stopped from"
shot stopped-with-distance
check_layout
